  "description": "Manual schema-scaffolding CLI for SmartTableSync - introspects a table (or generates the shared tracking infrastructure) and writes reviewable .sql files. Never executes anything against a database itself.",
  "id": "SmartTableSync.Scaffold",
  "isPrerelease": false,
